 class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">I loved this book! It gave me all I expected and so much more in this fourth book of the Ruthless Warlords series by Ms. Alison Aimes. With each new book of this incredible series, the author delivers us a book even better than the last and gives us more pieces of the puzzle to this wonderful tale. Filthy Royal is no exception, as so much more of the overall story is revealed.<br /><br />Because this is book four, I feel a little background is necessary. This story takes place in an alternate Omegaverse world somewhere in the galaxy. There are three major organizations that play heavily in this universe: The Brotherhood, a huge crime syndicate, The Consortium, an underworld organization peddling gambling, cage fights, sex and more, and The Federation, tasked with hunting down and imprisoning those criminals. The Slokov family is a bunch of orphaned siblings who fight, steal, and do whatever it takes to survive and protect their family, growing against all odds into one of the biggest and richest crime families. Each book is a standalone with its own plot, but if read in order, the entire family dynamics and story unfold.<br /><br />In Filthy Royal, our story is about Damien Skolov, starting when he is a young, cocky cage fighter before his family has become one of the leading crime families. This is where he meets Scarlett, property of the Consortium, who is a dancer and has been trained to be a prize to the winner of the ultimate cage fight. There is sweet love and romance, and brutal betrayal. Then, after four years, these two are brought back together for the rest of their story.<br /><br />I love the world building of this series in this alien world. There is never-ending action to keep you glued to the book and barely able to catch your breath before something else takes place! The characters Damien and Scarlett are so complex with chemistry that is off the charts. The sub-characters add so much more to the development of this overall plot, with all the twists and turns I did not see coming. For anyone who loves romance, get ready because this book is sizzling with romance!<br /><br />In the end, it is obvious that I loved this book! It would be a fantastic read for anyone who loves a steamy romance with a hot alpha male and a sassy omega coming into her own power. I can't stress enough that this series is so much more enjoyable if read in order!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">4 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 comment</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 