rth book in the series kept me captive from beginning to end. This author has such a way with words, descriptions, characters and storylines that make you feel a part of the books world! Damien is the youngest Skolov and is their Enforcer. He is looking for someone and when he comes across Scarlett, an Omega from his past, he is bound and determined to find out why she did the things she did. But will he believe her when she tells him the truth? Scarlett is a formidable Omega who will do anything and everything to protect those she loves. Can these two work out their differences and discover true love a second time?? This story broke me and put me back together. I laughed, I cried and I rooted for them throughout. This story has mystery, intrigue, lust and possibly love. The Skolov family protects their own and those they love and you could feel that protectiveness, that love, jump off the pages. And as for the sizzling chemistry between Damien and Scarlett?? I thought my kindle was going to burst into flames!! This story and series is a definite must read for all. Words cannot fully express how much I loved this five plus, plus, plus, story! Absolute perfection!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">3 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 comment</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review un