><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">*Update for audiobook narrated by Jason Clarke and Stella Hunter*<br /><br />There are no words to describe how incredible this book is in Audio. I know that I’m completely over the top for this series, but you know what? You listen to Jason Clarke and his sexy as all hells growly voice as Damien Skolov and tell me you don’t need a stiff drink and a cold shower afterwards, and if you don’t…..well this is a safe space and there will be no shaming of any kind! 😊 Seriously Stella and Jason just owned Damien and Scarlett, they bring such passion to every element of this story, the intensity of Damien and Scarlett’s love, the anguish, the violence, the need and the hope, they hold me hostage listening from the start to the very end. I’m such a huge fan of these two narrators. They are just wonderful!<br /><br />I remain obsessed with this series!<br /><br />I had read Filthy Beginnings the prequel to Filthy Royal (which is included in this book), so I already loved Scarlett and Damien and couldn’t wait to read the rest of their story. <br /><br />Filthy Royal picks up four planetary rotations after the events of Filthy Beginnings which again is included in this book so you can go from prequel right into the rest of the story and what an epic story it was! Alison Aimes writes some of the most fascinating, intense, and always captivating characters. Damien, the Skolov family enforcer, and Scarlett, his fated mate, will have you in every single one of your feels. They are destined to be together,  the love burns between them but secrets, lies and pain tore them apart and could destroy their future together. My heart just broke so many times for them. <br /><br />There are some big twists and turns in this book so I’m not going to give anything away but if you have read other books in this series you know you can expect brilliant writing, with amazing details and descriptions, intense feelings, explosive action, some of the most steamy sex ever written, possessive, obsessive alphas and unique strong omegas. Damien and Scarlett’s story will not disappoint you.<br /><br />I loved every minute and every page of this book. From the prequel to the HEA and the sneak peak at Anaya’s story (that I’m so excited about), it was everything I could have hoped for. I’m really looking forward to the audiobook of this one it’s going to be AMAZING!!!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">2 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.103634