mall" d="M24 9.63469C24 9.35683 23.7747 9.13158 23.4969 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></defs><use clip-path="url(#clip_RatingStar_undefined0small)" href="#path_RatingStar_undefined0small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7128030089">November 12, 2025</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Hard to rate this. I enjoyed a lot, including the writing, but hated the world our characters lived in. The h had no autonomy. Omegas are already submissive, this one is literally owned and used repeatedly by the bad guys. <br />In the prequal the h is forced into betraying the H and now he comes in and uses their old bond and her submissive need for him to torture her, and it was sad. We had such a good H who went too far because he was hurt. But the worst off was the h, and when H learns the truth, she doesn't make him grovel and wears the chain he used to hurt her with pride. UGH! We do get some shame for his behavior in his pov, but it was more about how he abandoned her for 4 years and not the specific shaming and using of her body. h had to use her powers to stop him from actually hurting her because she knew if he went that far she'd never forgive him.<br />Overall, I liked the growth of both and that the h was powerful, but it took me a while to finish this.<br /><br /><br /><br />SPOILERS:<br />H thinks that the h drugged and betrayed him because she wanted the rich alpha already in the Brotherhood. He also blames her for his friend dying in the last book. I understand why he is upset but wished he would have went back for answers. Instead, he left h to fend for herself for 4 years. <br />He is only back now because his family has found out that a half-brother of theirs is the one coming after them. They found another brother that they thought died years ago and realized that his twin sister is also alive. Only the half-brother bad guy knows where she is. As soon as he realized that his evil brother is working where his old fated mate is the H should have questioned everything. <br />Because 4 years ago they incapacitated the H, h's handler tried to rape her and her growing powers lashed out, immediately killing him. In walks in evil half-brother having recorded it all. He also has videos that would hurt her brother, threatens her friends who are also Omega prizes. Then shows h a live feed of the H passed out being threated. So, she drugged him. <br />The h is forced to marry a friend, steal, and kill for her former mates' brother. She isn't allowed to see her brother unless its to force her to comply with demands with a weapon pointed at his head. The h's ultimate plan is dark, and she is on the way to kill the bad guy when she runs into the H. They go into a rut, then he just keeps trapping her. Then he uses a taming chain he had made just for her. From my understanding these chains are used in brothels and can make Omega's feel more pleasure, thus subduing a woman about to be forced into sex. Then he mocks her, saying she ended up like her mother after all. I had angry tears.<br />Eventually H finds out the truth about how she was forced by his brother, what he's been doing to her, how her powers hurt her, and she's still a virgin (like him) because her husband is in love with her brother. Oh, and his friend didn't die, he was blackmailed and happily faked it. He was the one threating to kill him 4 years ago on the feed and is the brute hurting her brother currently, so she actually saved the H back then. <br />Then he finds out that her ultimate plan is just letting her powers completely loose, killing the bad guy and her, and hopefully setting everyone she loves free. He of course hates this plan. He finds out her powers are actively killing her and loses it. I actually liked that part. Wanted more grovel time and conversations about what he did to hurt her. <br />Her sister in laws are actually the ones that helped her. She was suppressing her powers, which is why they hurt, once she accepted them, she had more control and no pain. <br />The bad guy got away for another book, but h saw his stolen sister and she is safe.<br />Overall, a happy ending with their fated mate marks coming back and her pregnant, but I wanted a look into their life on his planet. <br />The bonus epilogue is his baby sister escaping to go after the bad guy only to be taken to a prison in a bad zone to be in, so I'll look into that one when it's out. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29296093?shelf=2025" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2025</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29296093?shelf=sci-fi" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">sci-fi</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29296093?shelf=virgin-hero-s-are-the-best" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="B