index="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">🖤 <b>“You’re my colors. My light. Without you, there’s nothing left but gray.”</b><br />~~~<br />Scarlett is an incredible woman! Being an Omega and also owned by the Consortium, her life hasn’t been easy. But despite all the hardships she’s been through, Scarlett shows such courage and resilience, facing and dealing with all the challenges thrown her way. Even more, she’s incredibly caring, protective and selfless, ready and willing to sacrifice so much (even herself) to save the people she cares about. And I also loved her defiance, fierceness and strength. Scarlett is truly amazing and I adored everything about her!<br /><br />And then, there’s Damien - the fourth brother of the Skolov family! This Alpha is one dangerous, lethal, violent and intense male. Even more, he’s confident, charming, fiercely protective, loyal and so deliciously possessive and dominant. Damien is a male who doesn’t hesitate to go after the things he wants. And that absolutely filthy mouth and mind of his! Damien is utterly irresistible and I couldn’t help but adore every single thing about him!<br /><br />I absolutely loved everything that happened between Scarlett and Damien! From the moment they met, they knew they were the ones for each other, but betrayal tears them apart. Now, four years later, Scarlett’s life has gone from bad to worse and Damien is back, not only on a mission to find his sister but also with fury and vengeance in his heart. I absolutely adored those two together! The tension, the bickering, the angst, the constant push and pull - I couldn’t get enough of every moment they spent together. And watching Damien and Scarlett rebuild trust and clear up the past was both heartbreaking and utterly incredible. Moreover, their chemistry was off-the-charts hot and when they couldn’t deny their bond and resist the undeniable need anymore, the passionate moments they shared were blazing hot and I couldn't get enough of all the deliciously filthy delight. Scarlett and Damien were truly perfect for each other and after all the pain and misery both went through, they more than deserved a second chance in happiness and love together.<br /><br />In addition, the storyline was phenomenal! Zaya is still missing, but the Skolovs will stop at nothing to find her. Even more, their half-brother is getting more dangerous with every passing moment. And unknown enemies are also lurking in the shadows. With everything happening and the unexpected turns of events, I was glued to the pages till the very end, excited how everything will be resolved.<br /><br />Overall, the story is another spectacular addition to the series! It’s filled with danger, action, suspense, twists, violence, betrayals, angst, drama, smoking-hot passion and incredible characters.<br /><br />I couldn’t put it down and absolutely loved every page of it!<br />And, with that epilogue, I cannot wait to see what happens next!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6132395?shelf=2025" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2025</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6132395?shelf=dark-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">dark-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6132395?shelf=pnr-sfr-fr" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">pnr-sfr-fr</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFoo