the first time she had ever known any happiness but the Brotherhood have long arms and are able to obtain evidence they can use against Scarlett and the only way she can keep the two men she cares for safe her brother and Damien safe is by caring out their instructions so he can not attain his goals and she would be forced into a living hell.<br />Four years later and Damien and his brothers are now back together and they are at another of the Brotherhood tournaments and when he sees her again for the first time it is as though time has stopped and she is still to be his Prime Omega, but he hates her for the betrayal that caused his friend to lose his life in the tournament. There is so much he does not know about the hell she has suffered over the last four years and she will never tell him, she is too ashamed.<br />I guarantee that when you begin reading this imply amazing book that you will not be able to put it down until you reach the end and discover the outcome.<br />I assure you that you will love every moment of this book it is simply a fantastic read.<br />I voluntarily received and review an Advanced Reader Copy<br />I thoroughly enjoyed the book and look forward to reading any future publications; keep up all the great writing.<br /></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">3 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg vi