k\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10717098?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-fantasy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10717098?shelf=paranormal-fantasy"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4595809465"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.4fJXdRHhfhLWQN-YOQEGpA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.4fJXdRHhfhLWQN-YOQEGpA","creator":{"__ref":"User:10717098"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1704904459094,"createdAt":1686267003075,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1704802727096,"text":"Filthy Royal is book four in the Ruthless Warlords series by Alison Aimes. This book also contained the prequel, Filthy Beginnings which is highly recommended you read first. You really need the back story to experience the impact of what is happening in Filthy Royal. This is an alpha/omega romance. It can be read as a stand alone BUT I’ve read the whole series and it’s amazing. You would definitely enjoy this more if you have met the rest of the Skolov family and gotten to know them.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1686267015i/34341690._SY540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDamien Skolov is the fourth and youngest brother in the Skolov family. When we first meet him in the prequel, he is eighteen years old and is a cage fighter, trying to win the grand prize for his family. But all his plans are thrown in the wind when he walks past HER! The dancer in the cage. The prize. His mate. Suddenly all that matters is her.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eScarlett is twenty one when we first meet her. She has never known life outside of the dome, outside of captivity. She has been trained and groomed to be the prize. And now it’s time. Only as soon as the alpha male crashes against the glass of her cage, she feels it. The unmistakable yearning for the alpha that is her fated mate. Only things don’t go as planned. Both Scarlett and Damien are merely pawns in a very ugly, twisted game. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFour years pass at the start of Filthy Royal. The Skolov family has finally risen the ranks in the Brotherhood. Damien is now the Skolov enforcer, and works hard to be worthy of his family. They are a close knit family. I love these siblings by the way. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1505147277i/23891063.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eScarlett is no longer a dancer. Her situation is worse than ever and she has spent the last four years plotting and planning to take those that have hurt her and her brother, Luc down. But then her life is thrown into turmoil when a certain alpha comes literally crashing back into her life. A very angry alpha that wants revenge.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1686267015i/34341689._SY540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOne thing about Alison’s books...you need an ice bath handy when you read them. This book is scorching hot. But it was also sweet, swoony and had some of the most romantic moments. Don’t get me wrong, there are plenty of gritty battles and lots of suspense. I especially like what Alison did with Scarlett’s brother, Luc. I would especially enjoy maybe a separate novella about his future life sometime. ‘hint hint’\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1667044376ra/33552654.gif\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSo, if you want a book that will keep you on the edge of your seat, make you fan yourself, but also make your tummy fill with butterflies, this is for you. We also get a tiny sneak peek into the next book, Enemy Princess. I can’t wait for Anya’s story!!!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e“In this lifetime, in the next, and in every one after that, I will always find you.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor more about this book and so many others, come and visit me at Carol's Crazy Bookish World.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/CarolsCrazyBookishWorld\"\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/groups/Carol...\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1502304251i/23548582.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HX9RKZVGY6BW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":61,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":8},"User:70316517":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":70316517,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1570843185i/70316517.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2764,"textReviewsCount":3284,"name":"Ꮗ€♫◗☿ ❤️ ilikebooksbest.com ❤️","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/70316517-ilikebooksbest-com","contributor":null,"id":70316517},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EGVfsUIEJNXkHH_C":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EGVfsUIEJNXkHH_C"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EGVfsUIEJNXkHH_C\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EGVfsUIEJNXkHH_C","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EGVfsUIEJNXkHH_C"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"00-audiobooks-i-own","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=00-audiobooks-i-own"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"action-adventure","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=action-adventure"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"aliens","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=aliens"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"audiobook","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=audiobook"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"erotic-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=erotic-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=paranormal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=mafia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"science-fiction","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/70316517?shelf=science-fiction"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6436344872"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.RhKO3FhiGt8SDfbRNxmpXg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.RhKO3FhiGt8SDfbRNxmpXg","creator":{"__ref":"User:70316517"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1718298341969,"createdAt":1716212735088,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1716687190751,"text":"\u003cb\u003eAnother great audiobook with duet narration!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1716212743i/35538570._SY540_.png\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe following ratings are out of 5:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRomance: 💚🖤💙💖\u003cbr\u003eHeat/Steam: 🔥🔥🔥\u003cbr\u003eStory/Plot: 📕📗📘📙\u003cbr\u003eWorld building: 🌏🌍🌎🌏\u003cbr\u003eCharacter development: 😄😮🙂🥰😍\u003cbr\u003eNarrator(s): 🎙🎙🎙🎙🎙\u003cbr\u003eNarration type: Duet Narration\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Hero:\u003c/b\u003e \u003cu\u003eDamien Skolov\u003c/u\u003e - he is another Skolov brother, an alpha male in the Anarcheim Alphaverse. His brother Nikolai Skolov is the head alpha boss of the Skolov clan in the Brotherhood syndicate and Damien is now his enforcer. He excels at fighting and is the most temperamental of the brothers. When he first met Scarlett at a fight tournament, he was just eighteen and he planned to win enough money in the tournament to buy the Skolov’s a seat at the brotherhood table. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe heroine:\u003c/b\u003e \u003cu\u003eScarlett\u003c/u\u003e - she was the prize, Consortium property. She was known as the ultimate prize for fighters at the arena and owned by the Consortium. The brotherhood attended the tournament to bet on the fighters, though Damien was one of the fighters and he hid behind Scarlett making her his with his words. He plans on winning the tournament and winning Scarlett. She loved that his focus never wavered from her. For the first time, she had hope that she might get her life back. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe Story:\u003c/b\u003e At the time, Damien was younger than many of the males in the tournament, though he was rumored to be as good as some of the best. He grew up as the 4th and youngest of the Skolov brothers and had been performing well in every rotation of the tournament. The fifth rotation of the tournament was a cage fight with a pit in the center, made up of the elite 100 combatants. It was a free for all and the winner would come out wealthy and win Scarlett. Damien knew immediately that Scarlett was his fated mate.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEgan Avatice, the high lackey of the consortium ruled over Scarlett, and she had to do whatever he said, and he had talked about a new sponsor who had something against Damien. Scarlett had been owned by the consortium her whole life, as did her brother Luke who was a fighter for the consortium. Though he wasn’t allowed to fight in the tournament since the consortium didn’t want their own fighters to win enough money to buy their freedom. Luke wanted to buy Scarlett’s freedom since most prized were just used by the winners for a short time until their shine wore off and then made into whores. Scarlett had her own escape plan before meeting Damien. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis book starts with a prequel which all of the events above were part of before the actual book began after Scarlett betrays Damian. It got exiting at times even though we could tell that things weren’t always going to go the way Damien expected. I liked the story and the characters, though I liked the previous book better. The actual book starts later after the tournament ends and after the events of the last book, when their brother Maddox had returned home with the Skolovs. Both Damian and Maddox were trying to track down their half brother Darvish Sarten, who had it out for the Skolov’s and the Brotherhood.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI have to admit, that I am not at all fond of the omegaverse world. Like many alien romance books, women are seen as lesser and only good for one thing especially to the alpha’s. Very few alphas actually feel protective of women, and value them as people. Women are often only seen as slaves or whores. Scarlett was a perfect example of this since she was owned by the Consortium even after she became a prime omega of the winner of the competition. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLike the previous audiobooks in this series, this one was told in dual points of view via duet narration and was narrated by Jason Clarke and Stella Hunter. These two are both terrific narrators and I really enjoy both of them, so when I know they are together and doing an audiobook in duet narration, I just have to buy it. Jason has a deep and sexy voice while Stella has a feminine yet intelligent sounding voice, both are perfect for these characters. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.ilikebooksbest.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBlog\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/wennel\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eGoodreads\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ilikebooksbest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFacebook\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ilikebooksbest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.twitter.com/wendysu020202\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eTwitter\u003c/a\u003e|\u003ca href=\"https://www.bookbub.com/profile/1895823057\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBookBub\u003c/a\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3J3RKFOMWF33B\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.EGVfsUIEJNXkHH_C\"}}"},"likeCount":24,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:145247010":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":145247010,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1685036903i/145247010._UY200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":570,"textReviewsCount":265,"name":"readabookonce","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/145247010-readabookonce","contributor":null,"id":145247010},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=alien"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"betrayal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=betrayal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"captivity","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=captivity"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=enemies-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=fated-mates"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=mafia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"one-sided-hate","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=one-sided-hate"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"revenge","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=revenge"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"second-chance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=second-chance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5726126438"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.n1UgLHVZEEeQsyCG66kD0g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.n1UgLHVZEEeQsyCG66kD0g","creator":{"__ref":"User:145247010"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1716584129720,"createdAt":1690651405500,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1690663849831,"text":"I thought, “This is book 4. Alison Aimes is not going to shock me with a foreshadowed plot twist again.” Well, aren’t I a fool because she did! MULTIPLE TIMES!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eMAIN CHARACTER NAMES AND AGES\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eScarlett (25) \u003cb\u003e|\u003c/b\u003e Damien Skolov (22)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eFEATURES\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e∘ sci-fi mafia romance\u003cbr /\u003e∘ omegaverse\u003cbr /\u003e∘ second chance\u003cbr /\u003e∘ fated mates\u003cbr /\u003e∘ lovers to enemies to lovers\u003cbr /\u003e∘ fmc sort of held prisoner by mmc\u003cbr /\u003e∘ dual virgins 🤭\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eREVIEW\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSecond chance romance is one of my least favorite tropes (top spot goes to cheating). In fact, if I see a romance is second chance, I will usually skip it. Sci-fi romances get a lot of leeway with me because damned if this didn’t make me reevaluate my hatred. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI hate second chance romance when the breakup is all angst and silly miscommunication, but when she betrays him to literally save his life? Yeah, I vibed. Furthered by the fact BOTH waited for the other, even though Damien “hated” Scarlett (his perception of the situation made this fair), I guess my new motto is “I hate second chance romance ASTERISK.”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWatching Scarlett and Damien rebuild trust and clear up the past was refreshing. Scarlett broke my heart because of the burdens she’s been forced to shoulder since he’s been gone (and her entire life to be honest). \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI did feel the story was a \u003ci\u003ebit\u003c/i\u003e drawn out due to inner monologues of “I’m a monster.” It’s frustrating to read the same thoughts over and over. And over. AND OVER. Perhaps I would’ve had a lot more patience for it if I hadn’t just got done reading \u003ca href=\"https://goodreads.com/book/show/59855919.Broken_Heir__Ruthless_Warlords___3_\" title=\"Broken Heir (Ruthless Warlords, #3) by Alison Aimes\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eBroken Heir\u003c/a\u003e, where it did the same thing.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRegardless of extended angst, the storyline was strong. We learn more about what the series antagonist has been up to (aside from tormenting the Skolovs), and he suffered major blows in this one. It was so satisfying watching the Skolovs win a battle.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis series has filled a void in me left by another, and I cannot wait to see what’s going to happen next. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eOW/OM DRAMA\u003c/b\u003e \u003ci\u003eminor OM\u003c/i\u003e — Damien is very jealous of Scarlett’s husband even though they are married in title only\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eCHEATING\u003c/b\u003e technically yes with each other— Scarlett and Damien start a relationship even though she is married; HOWEVER, the marriage was forced and neither love each other in that way\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eTHIRD ACT BREAKUP\u003c/b\u003e none\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eENDING\u003c/b\u003e HEA — near future epilogue\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003ePOV\u003c/b\u003e dual / third person\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eSPICE LEVEL\u003c/b\u003e 4 / 5\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eRATING\u003c/b\u003e 4.5 / 5","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}"},"likeCount":20,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":5},"User:121973797":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":121973797,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1767819075i/121973797._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":213,"textReviewsCount":201,"name":"Bluestockings Read","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/121973797-bluestockings-read","contributor":null,"id":121973797},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3P5EBE18722I":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3P5EBE18722I"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3P5EBE18722I\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3P5EBE18722I","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3P5EBE18722I"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/121973797?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"丨audio-via_alcꤷarc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/121973797?shelf=%E4%B8%A8audio-via_alc%EA%A4%B7arc"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","na