iffhanger involving Damien's sister Anya, who's in the next book.\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e» 𝙨𝙚𝙭 𝙞𝙣𝙛𝙤: Omegaverse biology, including \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"580284b4-f373-48f0-a9d6-8e630b8d477e\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"580284b4-f373-48f0-a9d6-8e630b8d477e\"\u003eknotting, purring, and slick. Sex toys. Lots of dirty talk—including 13 well-placed \"good girl\"s. Some degradation. Elements of bondage, discipline, anal play, and rough sex. Also a tied-up (but still bossy) Damien.\u003c/label\u003e First PIV scene at \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"83a1bde1-4e3a-41a1-8972-52889390a002\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"83a1bde1-4e3a-41a1-8972-52889390a002\"\u003e65%, but they are \u003cb\u003ehorny af\u003c/b\u003e while trying to fight the fated-mate rut haze, so there are tons of spicy scenes before that (starting on page 1). \u003cb\u003eBoth stayed celibate virgins even after their initial separation! 🥰\u003c/b\u003e \u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e» \u003cb\u003e⚠\u003c/b\u003e 𝗖𝗪𝘀 (𝗽𝗮𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗮𝗹): Dark themes, violence, death, some gore. Power imbalances and a couple dubious scenarios (Partly cause he kidnapped her. Also, both of them feel body betray0al due to the overwhelming pull of the mate bond.) On page: \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"a7ecfcfb-26a9-41c7-b1fa-6f90bf1b207c\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hi