ename":"Tag","name":"loved-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/22559866?shelf=loved-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/22559866?shelf=paranormal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"possessive-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/22559866?shelf=possessive-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"standalone","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/22559866?shelf=standalone"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"virgin-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/22559866?shelf=virgin-heroine"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5803351638"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.VKxgRFneglSiWKMu6C4PcQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.VKxgRFneglSiWKMu6C4PcQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:22559866"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1737268739624,"createdAt":1693697232938,"spoilerStatus":true,"lastRevisionAt":1693697508677,"text":"It’s a long read but it’s a great couple. \u003cbr /\u003eThere are a few hiccups so I didn’t give it a 5 star but they both wait for each other. This is a second chance romance but in case you’re wondering there is no one else in between. \u003cbr /\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A31RZPAJFWJHIZ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}"},"likeCount":5,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:103987494":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":103987494,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1574262603i/103987494._UY200_CR77,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":68,"textReviewsCount":901,"name":"Veronica Ticker","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/103987494-veronica-ticker","contributor":null,"id":103987494},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/103987494?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5828623350"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.-y7bPU3yFyqKW1b1Jkl8YA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.-y7bPU3yFyqKW1b1Jkl8YA","creator":{"__ref":"User:103987494"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1713627997035,"createdAt":1698326204066,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1698326238902,"text":"(audiobook) Knowing what their backstory was, I was curious to see how Damien and Scarlett would reconnect. It was going to be difficult. The book didn’t disappoint.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe author continues the Skolov story: they are still looking for their younger sister who was kidnapped. That means finding their half-brother. It’s Damien’s job as the family’s enforcer, and he crosses Scarlett’s path again, four years after her betrayal. There’s no love lost between them. Or is there?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFor various reasons, they keep secrets from each other. Secrets that would help clearing the air. It was frustrating, of course, that a single conversation could have prevented a lot of what happens to them in this book, and could have minimized their resentment. A conversation that never really happens. However, there wouldn’t be as much tension, nor much of a story. Also Damien doesn’t trust Scarlett anymore, and Scarlett’s secrets involve other people that she protects. It’s understandable that they wouldn’t want that conversation.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI enjoyed the whole side story–that becomes part of the main story–about Scarlett’s powers. In the prequel, we saw that she didn’t really understand it. In this book, she uses them but still has little control over them. They’re more like a curse for her, to be honest. But her meeting again with Damien will make her reevaluate the situation. And not really with Damien’s help, which was an interesting touch. All in all, in this series, omegas’ powers are more metaphores for women’s attributes than anything else.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDamien, on the other hand, is still kind of searching for his place in the family. He’s reckless because he always has something to prove. Which makes one particular scene near the end of the book absolutely beautiful. Let’s just say, he already has a place in his family, despite what he thinks. He isn’t alone.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved Damien. He’s young and brutal and angry. But his tough facade hides a mushy heart, one that was broken by Scarlett and that he’s kept from everyone since. He isn’t a soft man, but he loves fiercely.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere was a lot going on in this book besides the love story. The conspiracy–which explains what happened in the prequel and since then–is the most important part, but it has ramifications. Since it involves their half-brother, the whole Skolov family is concerned. And the second love story made me crave for more. A couple of twists finished the story beautifully.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe series’s narrators come back, and they nail it. The female narrator expresses both the strength and the vulnerabilities of Scarlett with talent, and the male narrator is perfect for any growly alpha males, even those with a big heart. An entertaining and well done audiobook.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eQuickie\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Series: Ruthless warlords #4 (can be read as a standalone)\u003cbr /\u003e- Hashtags: #SF romance #mafia romance #second chance romance #omegaverse #aliens #fated mates #virgin\u003cbr /\u003e- Triggers: lots of violence, abuse and death, mention of past extreme child abuse, female trafficking, cheating (technically)\u003cbr /\u003e- Main couple: Scarlett \u0026amp; Damien Skolov\u003cbr /\u003e- Hotness: 5/5\u003cbr /\u003e- Romance: 5/5\u003cbr /\u003e- + where do I start? secondary gay couple… extremely romantic alpha male… weirdly perfect family…\u003cbr /\u003e- – lack of communication as the main problem between the characters isn’t my favorite","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A39A6VVMKWFPTV\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}"},"likeCount":4,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:77019909":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":77019909,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1602985103i/77019909._UX200_CR0,26,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":13,"textReviewsCount":1031,"name":"Jean Stillman","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/77019909-jean-stillman","contributor":null,"id":77019909},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/77019909?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4994503635"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.10CRSdST4Hg2q0Wr62yEUQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.10CRSdST4Hg2q0Wr62yEUQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:77019909"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1691965985019,"createdAt":1685794438155,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1691965984865,"text":"I loved this book! It gave me all I expected and so much more in this fourth book of the Ruthless Warlords series by Ms. Alison Aimes. With each new book of this incredible series, the author delivers us a book even better than the last and gives us more pieces of the puzzle to this wonderful tale. Filthy Royal is no exception, as so much more of the overall story is revealed.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBecause this is book four, I feel a little background is necessary. This story takes place in an alternate Omegaverse world somewhere in the galaxy. There are three major organizations that play heavily in this universe: The Brotherhood, a huge crime syndicate, The Consortium, an underworld organization peddling gambling, cage fights, sex and more, and The Federation, tasked with hunting down and imprisoning those criminals. The Slokov family is a bunch of orphaned siblings who fight, steal, and do whatever it takes to survive and protect their family, growing against all odds into one of the biggest and richest crime families. Each book is a standalone with its own plot, but if read in order, the entire family dynamics and story unfold.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn Filthy Royal, our story is about Damien Skolov, starting when he is a young, cocky cage fighter before his family has become one of the leading crime families. This is where he meets Scarlett, property of the Consortium, who is a dancer and has been trained to be a prize to the winner of the ultimate cage fight. There is sweet love and romance, and brutal betrayal. Then, after four years, these two are brought back together for the rest of their story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI love the world building of this series in this alien world. There is never-ending action to keep you glued to the book and barely able to catch your breath before something else takes place! The characters Damien and Scarlett are so complex with chemistry that is off the charts. The sub-characters add so much more to the development of this overall plot, with all the twists and turns I did not see coming. For anyone who loves romance, get ready because this book is sizzling with romance!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn the end, it is obvious that I loved this book! It would be a fantastic read for anyone who loves a steamy romance with a hot alpha male and a sassy omega coming into her own power. I can't stress enough that this series is so much more enjoyable if read in order!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2Y9IQGZ3D928M\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":4,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:10209236":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10209236,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1581282028i/10209236._UX200_CR0,24,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":77,"textReviewsCount":2288,"name":"Kay Daniels (Kay Daniels Romance)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10209236-kay-daniels-kay-daniels-romance","contributor":null,"id":10209236},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=dark-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-or-rivals-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=enemies-or-rivals-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fantasy-sci-fi-pnr-supernatural","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=fantasy-sci-fi-pnr-supernatural"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mystery-intrigue-suspense","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=mystery-intrigue-suspense"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"second-chance-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=second-chance-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10209236?shelf=fated-mates"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4792370132"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.uQcg8KSlOdsJV6VCj-nZmQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.uQcg8KSlOdsJV6VCj-nZmQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:10209236"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1687021826365,"createdAt":1686363152842,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1687021826236,"text":"Filthy and sweet, with high adrenaline and full of emotions. Filthy Royal was a thrilling ride that I didn't want to exit from.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe book begins with the prequel, Filthy Beginnings, which highlights the fast paced and, somewhat unusual, courtship that transpires between Damien and Scarlett.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eScarlett is Consortium property and is set as part of the winnings, a prize to be won, in the tournament of cage fighters entering a galactic fighting tournament. She's a beautiful dancer that shimmers colors and is kept in a glass cage. Her entire life has been under Consortium rule and her only hope is to be won by a fair and just fighter, which she knows is unlikely, or to escape. With odds stacked against her, she would still rather try to run than give up her life to a brute. That is until she meets Damien.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEnter Damien Skolov, a young fighter with nothing to his name and proving his worth through using his fists. Damien originally only entered the tournament to win the cash prize, but the moment he sees Scarlett he's sucked into her orbit and the mating heat hits both of them hard and fast. While he still wants the money, he also wants to win Scarlett and her freedom. He's young and impetuous, but he's also gentle and sweet when it comes to Scarlett. Yes, he also shows her how dirty he can be without jeopardizing her actual purity, and let me tell you, these two burn for one another.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTheir quick time at the tournament blazes hot and fast and there is a lot that transpires due to the quickness of their time together, there is also a lot that happens that also tears them apart just as quickly. This beginning part of the story shapes their future and jump starts their destiny to how they meet again, but under very different circumstances. It's heartbreaking, but I LOVED how Alison set up this part of the story to continue on with the rest. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved Damien Skolov (his brother Maddox and sister Anya too, but for now I'm just going to focus on Damien). He is an Alpha with heart, humility, and an understanding of those around him. I'd say his sweet side or his soft side is something that is unique or contrary to the other Skolov Alpha's. He's in tune with his siblings and how they function within the family. He also gives a hand to those who need help and it's his compassion that sets him apart in so many ways. Yes, he's very much an Alpha with all the possessive, protective, and obsessive traits that make him OTT, but he has this sweet charm that, I think sets him apart from his brothers and made him extremely personable. He's compassionate with his younger siblings and he uses their strengths to help lead and teach them. To me, displaying how good of a dad he's going to be, when the time is right. (I do hope the other Skolov's all get a book because I love how much I got to know them in this story).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eScarlett is a sweet and sensitive soul, but also strong all rolled into one beautiful and gifted omega. Her protective nature almost makes her a martyr, willing to sacrifice herself to save those she loves. I believe it's her inner strength that shoots out in colors, making her desirable and one of the most wanted omega's in the galaxy. For Damien alone, she really let's her colors splash and he's constantly in awe of her beauty.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDamien is also one of the few men Scarlett stands up to, which he both loves and finds annoying. Where most people would cower down at the brute enforcer, it is their familiarity that gives her strength to take on the Alpha. They are both brutal to one another considering the way they parted, both placing blame, though really neither is the cause. However, even with the animosity in the air, in their core there is always a stirring of love and tons of chemistry that shines through even when they say mean things. I love their protective nature and the ultimate caring for each other no matter how much blustering they make. It's the kind of pull that brings me back again and again to Alison's stories.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFilthy Royal has twists and turns and is jammed packed with high adrenaline action. Literally, the book is riddled with fights, people to save, buildings crumbling, near death defying escapes, and so much more that I could go on and on. On top of all the action there are is also the burning passion and several deeply emotional moments that Damien and Scarlett share. These two experience a lot together and I loved experiencing it all with them.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17G64B1NBQVVW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:36162361":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":36162361,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":38,"textReviewsCount":1898,"name":"Joy Westerfield","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/36162361-joy-westerfield","contributor":null,"id":36162361},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ELW1RUOLM8B0"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/36162361?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5595340647"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.gtOeI_jJV1bMAwrdgB0ntw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.gtOeI_jJV1bMAwrdgB0ntw","creator":{"__ref":"User:36162361"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1686818957531,"createdAt":1685891154521,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1686818957401,"text":"Have you ever read a book where you never wanted it to end? Where the characters have so ingrained themselves into your heart, that you can’t help but want more of their story? Well, let me tell you this, it is exactly how I feel about Damien and Scarlett’s story! This fourth book in the series kept me captive from beginning to end. This author has such a way with words, descriptions, characters and storylines that make you feel a part of the books world! Damien is the youngest Skolov and is their Enforcer. He is looking for someone and when he comes across Scarlett, an Omega from his past, he is bound and determined to find out why she did the things she did. But will he believe her when she tells him the truth? Scarlett is a formidable Omega who will do anything and everything to protect those she loves. Can these two work out their differences and discover true love a second time?? This story broke me and put me back together. I laughed, I cried and I rooted for them throughout. This story has mystery, intrigue, lust and possibly love. The Skolov family protects their own and those they love and you could feel that protectiveness, that love, jump off the pages. And as for the sizzling chemistry between Damien and Scarlett?? I thought my kindle was going to burst into flames!! This story and series is a definite must read for all. Words cannot fully express how much I loved this five plus, plus, plus, story! Absolute perfection!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\