l, passion, and jealousy.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe storyline has unexpected twists and turns as well as a second chance love that they have to fight insurmountable obstacles to obtain. The connection between Damien and Scarlett is intense and extremely hot. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved seeing Damien interact with his younger brother Maddox and his sister Anya. He’s more than just a brutal enforcer, he has heart and a softness for his loved ones, along with a huge protective streak. I am so ready for Anya’s story and the conclusion of this series. It’s been an incredible journey through all the treachery the Skolov siblings and their fated mates have faced.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI received a free ARC from the author and 1852 Media; and I am voluntarily leaving an unbiased review.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A38E9ALOSJ5PJW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:103813465":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":103813465,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1762303491i/103813465._UX200_CR0,48,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":8,"textReviewsCount":726,"name":"Vedece Barnes","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/103813465-vedece-barnes","contributor":null,"id":103813465},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOFDLORZIK86N":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOFDLORZIK86N"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOFDLORZIK86N\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOFDLORZIK86N","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOFDLORZIK86N"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTq