u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI've been waiting on Damien's story and it delivered everything and more. Filthy Royal blew my mind. Left me feeling dirty in all the magnificent ways that only Damien can. Absolutely deliciously filthy. He is paired with his perfect equal, Scarlett. I just love her. Strong, beautiful, a woman after my own heart. Damien and Scarlett have a love for the ages.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A33IQQBZ9MXRUY\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:119849957":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":119849957,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1766935420i/119849957._UX200_CR0,25,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":52,"textReviewsCount":1395,"name":"Jodi - JodiReadsnListens","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/119849957-jodi---jodireadsnlistens","contributor":null,"id":119849957},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A24D0TQRE1YPQD":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A24D0TQRE1YPQD"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A24D0TQRE1YPQD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A24D0TQRE1YPQD","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A24D0TQRE1YPQD"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/119849957?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5895426035"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1._aXOGDgqE5YRAYBl_rjYbA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1._aXOGDgqE5YRAYBl_rjYbA","creator":{"__ref":"User:119849957"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1698604728118,"createdAt":1696943310407,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1698327933315,"text":"**Audio Review**\u003cbr /\u003eHells yes! Filthy Royal by Alison Aimes was a dark and sexy second-chance fated-mates romance that I devoured from start to finish. I was instantly hooked on Damien and Scarlett’s forbidden love story in Filthy Beginnings, so I was excited for them to finally find their very own HEA. However, their journey to get there was full of steamy twists and unexpected turns! Alison’s Ruthless Warlord series never disappoints!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eStella Hunter and Jason Clarke perform this audiobook in duet style narration, and both are always pure perfection bringing Alison’s characters to life. Stella portrayed Scarlett’s vulnerable, and passionate persona brilliantly making you long for her to find a way to break free of all her secrets and bonds. Jason’s deep growly timbre complimented alpha Damien’s dominant, protective, and determined personality perfectly. Both narrators brought the HEAT with Damien and Scarlett’s smoking hot-fated mate chemistry!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, I LOVED this book. If you are a fan of a fated-mates omegaverse romance with a hot alpha ex-cage fighter, a fierce and feisty omega ex-dancer, enemies to lovers vibes, lies, protecting the ones you love, becoming the family enforcer, secrets, betrayal, taming chains, healing from the past, misunderstandings, defeating an alien mafia boss, super HOT steamy times, a jaw-dropping plot twist, and a HEA that will do filthy good things to your heart, then you will love Damien and Scarett’s story. I always look forward to more from Alison Aimes.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A24D0TQRE1YPQD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:42497829":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":42497829,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1654652568i/42497829._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3,"textReviewsCount":150,"name":"Jojoreadsromance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/42497829-jojoreadsromance","contributor":null,"id":42497829},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZSLKVTF40CS":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZSLKVTF40CS"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZSLKVTF40CS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZSLKVTF40CS","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZSLKVTF40CS"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/42497829?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5632639348"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.UMTFUqT-duUnZMiepkAJrw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.UMTFUqT-duUnZMiepkAJrw","creator":{"__ref":"User:42497829"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1726906235634,"createdAt":1687778332028,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1698380637361,"text":"*Update for audiobook narrated by Jason Clarke and Stella Hunter*\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere are no words to describe how incredible this book is in Audio. I know that I’m completely over the top for this series, but you know what? You listen to Jason Clarke and his sexy as all hells growly voice as Damien Skolov and tell me you don’t need a stiff drink and a cold shower afterwards, and if you don’t…..well this is a safe space and there will be no shaming of any kind! 😊 Seriously Stella and Jason just owned Damien and Scarlett, they bring such passion to every element of this story, the intensity of Damien and Scarlett’s love, the anguish, the violence, the need and the hope, they hold me hostage listening from the start to the very end. I’m such a huge fan of these two narrators. They are just wonderful!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI remain obsessed with this series!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI had read Filthy Beginnings the prequel to Filthy Royal (which is included in this book), so I already loved Scarlett and Damien and couldn’t wait to read the rest of their story. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFilthy Royal picks up four planetary rotations after the events of Filthy Beginnings which again is included in this book so you can go from prequel right into the rest of the story and what an epic story it was! Alison Aimes writes some of the most fascinating, intense, and always captivating characters. Damien, the Skolov family enforcer, and Scarlett, his fated mate, will have you in every single one of your feels. They are destined to be together,  the love burns between them but secrets, lies and pain tore them apart and could destroy their future together. My heart just broke so many times for them. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere are some big twists and turns in this book so I’m not going to give anything away but if you have read other books in this series you know you can expect brilliant writing, with amazing details and descriptions, intense feelings, explosive action, some of the most steamy sex ever written, possessive, obsessive alphas and unique strong omegas. Damien and Scarlett’s story will not disappoint you.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved every minute and every page of this book. From the prequel to the HEA and the sneak peak at Anaya’s story (that I’m so excited about), it was everything I could have hoped for. I’m really looking forward to the audiobook of this one it’s going to be AMAZING!!!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZSLKVTF40CS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v3.RlkoR9T8-Jd3kGtW":{"__typename":"Contributor","id":"kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v3.RlkoR9T8-Jd3kGtW","works":{"__typename":"ContributorWorksConnection","totalCount":63}},"User:63258978":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":63258978,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1770062954i/63258978._UX200_CR0,25,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":true,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":99,"textReviewsCount":2489,"name":"Cassandra Doon","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/63258978-cassandra-doon","contributor":{"__ref":"Contributor:kca://author/amzn1.gr.author.v3.RlkoR9T8-Jd3kGtW"},"id":63258978},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LP3E5ZC30RS8":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LP3E5ZC30RS8"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LP3E5ZC30RS8\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LP3E5ZC30RS8","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LP3E5ZC30RS8"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/63258978?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5987265380"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goo