www.goodreads.com/review/list/114577374?shelf=second-chance-friends-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi-alien","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/114577374?shelf=sci-fi-alien"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5680187473"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Y7lhEGgKUC6vggHs-XwXOA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Y7lhEGgKUC6vggHs-XwXOA","creator":{"__ref":"User:114577374"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1691393511821,"createdAt":1688937411785,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1688937798311,"text":"1.5 rounded up to 2 stars\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis took me so long to finish and I skimmed through most of it. I just couldn't connect to the MCs, the first 60% proceeded at a snails's pace with nothing much of importance happening, it picked up for a few chapter after but then lost steam all over again. There wasn't much of a plot and whatever new revelations were introduced, they weren't explored enough for me to take any amount of interest in them. This series started out so good and has progressively gotten worse with each new entry. Not sure if I'll be coming back for the next book.","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AZRV9HQF1E5NP\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:163754281":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":163754281,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":480,"name":"Simone","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/163754281-simone","contributor":null,"id":163754281},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A194Q0Q0FGPRX5":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A194Q0Q0FGPRX5"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A194Q0Q0FGPRX5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A194Q0Q0FGPRX5","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A194Q0Q0FGPRX5"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/163754281?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5807055181"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023083013.8c891c28-34f1-4750-8779-b1ef1f5b4d42":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023083013.8c891c28-34f1-4750-8779-b1ef1f5b4d42","creator":{"__ref":"User:163754281"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1693401649726,"createdAt":1693401622363,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1693401649579,"text":"🤩 🤗 Spoilerfreie Rezension: ❤️weiterer Keeper und kein Ende in Sicht: rasante Action, packende Charaktere🤗🤩 ❤️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eGerade habe ich das Buch „Schmutziger Lord – Eine dunkle Romanze zweier Schicksalsgefährten (Herzlose Warlords Teil 4)“ beendet. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBitte beachten, dass bei diesem Buch in der deutschen Ausgabe auch \"Schmutzige Anfänge\", das Prequel enthalten ist! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIch gebe generell keine Zusammenfassung des Buches ab, weil ich der Meinung bin, dass diese auch durch den Klappentext beim Buch schon aussagefähig ist. Insofern schildere ich hier lediglich meine Eindrücke, da dadurch sichergestellt wird, dass definitiv nicht gespoilert wird 😊\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAutor:\u003cbr /\u003eVon Alison Aimes kannte ich vor diesem Buch bereits die anderen Bände dieser Serie. Nicht immer halten Nachfolgebände die Spannung, zuweilen gibt es Längen. Aber im Fall von Alison Aimes ist es so, dass sie sich von Buch zu Buch noch mehr steigert. Mich hat „Schmutziger Lord“ wieder derart in den Bann gezogen hat, dass ich es nicht erwarten kann, das nächste Buch der Serie zu lesen *sehnsüchtigdaraufwarte*! 😉\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCover:\u003cbr /\u003eDas Cover selbst hat mir – wieder einmal - echt gut gefallen. 🥰 Ich finde, es weckt sofort die Neugier, was sich dahinter verbirgt. Gleichzeitig sieht es düster und bedrohlich aus, und das Tattoo „Death“ passt wunderbar. Ich finde es toll, dass man erneut das gleiche Cover wie im englischen Original verwendet hat! 😍\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTitel:\u003cbr /\u003eDer Titel des Buches passt wieder einmal wie die Faust aufs Auge! Darüberhinaus ist der Titel definitiv Programm und passt wunderbar zu der Geschichte! Und wer sich darunter nichts vorstellen kann: das ist nicht schlimm. Einfach zum nächsten Buchhändler des Vertrauens gehen und lesen! Ihr werdet es nicht bereuen!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSchreibstil:\u003cbr /\u003eDer Schreibstil von Alison Aimes ist – wieder einmal - absolut mitreißend. Es geht wirklich zur Sache: sowohl was die Geschehnisse - aber auch die Sprache angeht. Die Ganze Serie hat mich total begeistert – und dieses Buch ist keine Ausnahme. Im Gegenteil: ich finde, dass sich Alison mit diesem Buch noch mal extrem gesteigert hat! Das Ganze ist definitiv tempo- und actionreich, zuweilen wirklich deftig und nicht unbedingt etwas für schwache Nerven! Und deshalb kann man nur empfehlen, diese Bücher zu lesen! Sie sind wirklich einzigartig und toll! Deshalb gibt es auch keine Ermüdungserscheinungen oder Langeweile! \u003cbr /\u003eAlison Aimes katapultiert einen direkt in das Geschehen und man kann nicht aufhören zu lesen, bis man auf der letzten Seite angelangt ist! Es gibt unerwartete Wendungen und das Ganze erinnert an eine Achterbahnfahrt im Dunkeln: man weiß nie, in welcher Richtung es weitergeht. ❤️❤️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDarüberhinaus gibt es bei diesem Buch eine Besonderheit: Wer dieses Buch kauft, bekommt gleich zwei (!!) Bücher in einem: \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eZunächst gibt es das Prequel „Schmutzige Anfänge“, damit man besser verstehen kann, was die beiden an- und umtreibt und dann kommt das eigentliche Buch! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNach wie vor ist die Autorin – gerade oder obwohl man bereits Bücher von ihr kennt – absolut unvorhersehbar ist und bleibt. Ich liebe das sehr! Und das ist etwas, was einen auch bereits nach dem Lesen und Beenden dieses Buches, schon nach dem Nächsten fiebern lässt. Allerdings möchte ich betonen, dass die Bücher in sich abgeschlossen sind, bestimmte Handlungsstränge sich jedoch über die Bände hinwegziehen! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eProtagonisten:\u003cbr /\u003eObwohl ich die anderen Bände der Serie bereits gelesen hatte, finde ich das Setting immer noch relativ einzigartig. Es hat wirklich Elemente und Inhalte, die überraschen, die Geschichte ist definitiv rasant, spicy – und die Charaktere sind ebenfalls heiß! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAuch hier zeigt sich wieder, dass Alison Aimes mit ihrer Art zu schreiben die Charaktere bildgewaltig zeichnet. Man hat sofort die jeweiligen Bilder vor Augen. Man kann es nur so beschreiben: Kopfkino in Bestform! Die Szenen des Buches sind definitiv heiß – und unwahrscheinlich mitreißend.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eStimmung/Atmosphäre:\u003cbr /\u003eDüster. Erotisch. Heiß. Temporeich. Erschütternd. Herzzerreißend! Und einfach nur genial!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSetting:\u003cbr /\u003eEinzigartig! Auch wenn man schon Bücher dieser Serie gelesen hat! Das Ganze packt einen so sehr, dass zumindest ich um diese Autorin und diese Serie definitiv keinen Bogen mehr machen kann oder werde! Mir machte es total viel Spaß! Großartig!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eExplizite Szenen:\u003cbr /\u003eGerade bei diesem Genre und Setting kann man sich darauf einstellen, dass „Blümchensex“ hier keine Rolle spielt…. Insofern sind die expliziten Szenen nichts für die zartbesaiteten Leser, sondern sind schon eben das: explizit und deutlich, es geht wirklich „zur Sache“! Darüber hinaus spielt Feminismus hier wirklich keine große Rolle. Wer also damit Probleme hat oder haben könnte und eher auf die sanftere Art steht, sollte ggf. die Finger von dieser Reihe lassen. Was man dann aber auch ehrlicherweise sagen muss: es entgeht euch dann was. Diese Reihe ist der absolute Hammer! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKritikpunkte:\u003cbr /\u003eHier gibt es – für mich – definitiv keine! Nicht einen einzigen 😉🥰\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFazit:\u003cbr /\u003eEs war erneut ein großartiges Buch das definitiv Lust auf mehr macht. Ich kann es kaum erwarten, die nächsten Bände dieser Reihe zu lesen! Also von meiner Sicht aus eine totale und voll überzeugte Leseempfehlung für alle, die mit dem Setting keine Probleme haben. Ihr habt dann wirklich einen Keeper, den ihr euer Eigen nennen könnt! Versprochen! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eUnd damit ihr das Lesevergnügen in der richtigen Reihenfolge lesen könnt:\u003cbr /\u003eHerzloser König – Eine dunkle Romanze zweier Schicksalsgefährten (Herzlose Warlords Teil 1) \u003cbr /\u003eGrausamer Prinz – Eine dunkle Romanze zweier Schicksalsgefährten (Herzlose Warlords Teil 2)\u003cbr /\u003eGebrochener Erbe – Eine dunkle Romanze zweier Schicksalsgefährten (Herzlose Warlords Teil 3)\u003cbr /\u003eSchmutziger Lord – Eine dunkle Romanze zweier Schicksalsgefährten (Herzlose Warlords Teil 4), inclusive dem Prequel „Schmutzige Anfänge“.\u003cbr /\u003etbc\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBewertung: \u003cbr /\u003eEine voll und ganz überzeugte 5-⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Sterne-Empfehlung für ein großartiges Buch mit einem wichtigen Prequel!\u003cbr /\u003eInsofern eine klare, definitive Leseempfehlung! Holt euch dieses Buch! Ihr werdet es nicht bereuen! 😉🤗\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eInfo:\u003cbr /\u003eDas Buch habe ich im Rahmen einer Leserunde bei LovelyBooks vorab gelesen und durfte mich mit anderen Lesern darüber austauschen. Selbstverständlich hat dies meine Meinung zum Buch in keinster Weise beeinflusst.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A194Q0Q0FGPRX5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:29296093":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":29296093,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1517609189i/29296093._UY200_CR77,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":502,"name":"Grace","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/29296093-grace","contributor":null,"id":29296093},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2O8G92I6KN4LJ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2O8G92I6KN4LJ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2O8G92I6KN4LJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2O8G92I6KN4LJ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2O8G92I6KN4LJ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29296093?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"virgin-hero-s-are-the-best","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29296093?shelf=virgin-hero-s-are-the-best"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2025","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29296093?shelf=2025"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/29296093?shelf=sci-fi"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7128030089"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.6Li_oaG6QBzQIBu0NVwsww":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.6Li_oaG6QBzQIBu0NVwsww","creator":{"__ref":"User:29296093"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1762976650828,"createdAt":1762973569831,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1762976650226,"text":"Hard to rate this. I enjoyed a lot, including the writing, but hated the world our characters lived in. The h had no autonomy. Omegas are already submissive, this one is literally owned and used repeatedly by the bad guys. \u003cbr /\u003eIn the prequal the h is forced into betraying the H and now he comes in and uses their old bond and her submissive need for him to torture her, and it was sad. We had such a good H who went too far because he was hurt. But the worst off was the h, and when H learns the truth, she doesn't make him grovel and wears the chain he used to hurt her with pride. UGH! We do get some shame for his behavior in his pov, but it was more about how he abandoned her for 4 years and not the specific shaming and using of her body. h had to use her powers to stop him from actually hurting her because she knew if he went that far she'd never forgive him.\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, I liked the growth of both and that the h was powerful, but it took me a while to finish this.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSPOILERS:\u003cbr /\u003eH thinks that the h drugged and betrayed him because she wanted the rich alpha already in the Brotherhood. He also blames her for his friend dying in the last book. I understand why he is upset but wished he would have went back for answers. Instead, he left h to fend for herself for 4 years. \u003cbr /\u003eHe is only back now because his family has found out that a half-brother of theirs is the one coming after them. They found another brother that they thought died years ago and realized that his twin sister is also alive. Only the half-brother bad guy knows where she is. As soon as he realized that his evil brother is working where his old fated mate is the H should have questioned everything. \u003cbr /\u003eBecause 4 years ago they incapacitated the H, h's handler tried to rape her and her growing powers lashed out, immediately killing him. In walks in evil half-brother having recorded it all. He also has videos that would hurt her brother, threatens her friends who are also Omega prizes. Then shows h a live feed of the H passed out being threated. So, she drugged him. \u003cbr /\u003eThe h is forced to marry a friend, steal, and kill for her former mates' brother. She isn't allowed to see her brother unless its to force her to comply with demands with a weapon pointed at his head. The h's ultimate plan is dark, and she is on the way to kill the bad guy when she runs into the H. They go into a rut, then he just keeps trapping her. Then he uses a taming chain he had made just for her. From my understanding these chains are used in brothels and can make Omega's feel more pleasure, thus subduing a woman about to be forced into sex. Then he mocks her, saying she ended up like her mother after all. I had angry tears.\u003cbr /\u003eEventually H finds out the truth about how she was forced by his brother, what he's been doing to her, how her powers hurt her, and she's still a virgin (like him) because her husband is in love with her brother. Oh, and his friend didn't die, he was blackmailed and happily faked it. He was the one threating to kill him 4 years ago on the feed and is the brute hurting her brother currently, so she actually saved the H back then. \u003cbr /\u003eThen he finds out that her ultimate plan is just letting her powers completely loose, killing the bad guy and her, and hopefully setting everyone she loves free. He of course hates this plan. He finds out her powers are actively killing her and loses it. I actually liked that part. Wanted more grovel time and conversations about what he did to hurt her. \u003cbr /\u003eHer sister in laws are actually the ones that helped her. She was suppressing her powers, which is why they hurt, once she accepted them, she had more control and no pain. \u003cbr /\u003eThe bad guy got away for another book, but h saw his stolen sister and she is safe.\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, a happy ending with their fated mate marks coming back and her pregnant, but I wanted a look into their life on his planet. \u003cbr /\u003eThe bonus epilogue is his baby sister escaping to go after the bad guy only to be taken to a prison in a bad zone to be in, so I'll look into that one when it's out. ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2O8G92I6KN4LJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:42385062":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":42385062,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1589497157i/42385062._UY200_CR18,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":19,"textReviewsCount":2953,"name":"LeMiliere","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/42385062-lemiliere","contributor":null,"id":42385062},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/42385062?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5995156853"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023112215.33268e49-3456-46cf-a513-de25cce2ce85":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023112215.33268e49-3456-46cf-a513-de25cce2ce85","creator":{"__ref":"User:42385062"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1700665930434,"createdAt":1700665916510,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1700665930279,"text":"My review is written voluntarily after listening to the audio version of this book.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI have to start with an admission, this may be the fourth book in this series but it's the first one I have listened to although I had read Filthy Beginnings the prequel to Damien and Scarlett's story which thankfully is included in this audiobook.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhen Scarlett and Damien first met she was the prize in a galactic fighting tournament he is taking part in, she's considered property by the Consortium to be used as they see fit. Damien is a young alpha trying to find his place in his family where his brothers have already proven themselves. So he has entered the tournament for the prize money and the prestige winning will bring. What he wasn't expecting was Scarlett, part of the prize but also his fated mate!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe attraction and connection are instant, they’re fated mates something they know but she's to be given to the winning fighter and that may not be him. They’re young he's only 18 and she’s only a couple years older than him but they’ll risk everything, do anything to be together but then.........\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAt this point, you will be so glad that you can go straight into Filthy Royal which picks up their story four years later. Four hellish, heartbreaking years apart have changed both of them. Four years in which he has believed she betrayed him and caused the death of his friend. Although I loved younger Damien, I believe he was too immature, too hot-headed, to deal with the situation they were in then and Scarlett made the choice she believed would be best for everyone but......\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhen they meet again, he believes he's over her but far from it, a red hot rut haze comes on fast just as all hell is breaking loose. They're in the middle of a battle unhinged and disregarding the risks just wanting each other and Damien's younger brother Maddox has to try and keep them alive while trying to talk them down.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDamien is still furious over what happened four years ago, but he doesn't know the reason for Scarlett's actions and Scarlett's life which may look perfect from the outside is far from what it seems. As they spend time together, learning the truth about past actions, and even learning to trust each other again you can't help but want a happy outcome this time around. But will that be possible?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI'm not going to give any spoilers what I will say Is I loved every minute of this book, I was on the edge of my seat, hooked and waiting to see what other obstacles would be placed in their path. The shocks and surprises just kept coming and I couldn't stop listening. The characters are so well drawn and their development is so well done. The storyline is excellent with amazing details and descriptions, intense feelings, explosive action, some of the most steamy sex scenes I've listened to as well as possessive, obsessive alphas and unique strong omegas. Damien and Scarlett’s story will not disappoint you but please be aware there are some triggers so please check if you're concerned as this book includes dark subject matters\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe narration is by two very talented artists Stella Hunter is perfection as Scarlett and Anaya and Jason Clarke brings so much depth and feeling to the characters especially Damien his range is perfect for the flirty, playful younger Damien and the mature, tortured, jaded Alpha he becomes. Only to then get softer where Scarlett is concerned.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAll in all every minute of this book was excellent from the prequel to the sneak peek at Anaya’s story which I am so looking forward to listening to.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32U2ZHNBYS2XS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:6132395":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":6132395,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1761300129i/6132395._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":27,"textReviewsCount":967,"name":"Nevena","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/6132395-nevena","contributor":null,"id":6132395},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B86H6P4DHSMQ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B86H6P4DHSMQ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B86H6P4DHSMQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B86H6P4DHSMQ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B86H6P4DHSMQ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6132395?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2025","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6132395?shelf=2025"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6132395?shelf=dark-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"pnr-sfr-fr","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6132395?shelf=pnr-sfr-fr"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"scifi-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/6132395?shelf=scifi-romance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5195979083"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2025012719.b3976e76-8124-4eeb-a9d9-b8f3744e7ca4":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2025012719.b3976e76-8124-4eeb-a9d9-b8f3744e7ca4","creator":{"__ref":"User:6132395"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1738005004386,"createdAt":1738004979046,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1738005004235,"text":"🖤 \u003cb\u003e“You’re my colors. My light. Without you, there’s nothing left but gray.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e~~~\u003cbr /\u003eScarlett is an incredible woman! Being an Omega and also owned by the Consortium, her life hasn’t been easy. But despite all the hardships she’s been through, Scarlett shows such courage and resilience, facing and dealing with all the challenges thrown her way. Even more, she’s incredibly caring, protective and selfless, ready and willing to sacrifice so much (even herself) to save the people she cares about. And I also loved her defiance, fierceness and strength. Scarlett is truly amazing and I adored everything about her!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd then, there’s Damien - the fourth brother of the Skolov family! This Alpha is one dangerous, lethal, violent and intense male. Even more, he’s confident, charming, fiercely protective, loyal and so deliciously possessive and dominant. Damien is a male who doesn’t hesitate to go after the things he wants. And that absolutely filthy mouth and mind of his! Damien is utterly irresistible and I couldn’t help but adore every single thing about him!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI absolutely loved everything that happened between Scarlett and Damien! From the moment they met, they knew they were the ones for each other, but betrayal tears them apart. Now, four years later, Scarlett’s life has gone from bad to worse and Damien is back, not only on a mission to find his sister but also with fury and vengeance in his heart. I absolutely adored those two together! The tension, the bickering, the angst, the constant push and pull - I couldn’t get enough of every moment they spent together. And watching Damien and Scarlett rebuild trust and clear up the past was both heartbreaking and utterly incredible. Moreover, their chemistry was off-the-charts hot and when they couldn’t deny their bond and resist the undeniable need anymore, the passionate moments they shared were blazing hot and I couldn't get enough of all the deliciously filthy delight. Scarlett and Damien were truly perfect for each other and after all the pain and misery both went through, they more than deserved a second chance in happiness and love together.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn addition, the storyline was phenomenal! Zaya is still missing, but the Skolovs will stop at nothing to find her. Even more, their half-brother is getting more dangerous with every passing moment. And unknown enemies are also lurking in the shadows. With everything happening and the unexpected turns of events, I was glued to the pages till the very end, excited how everything will be resolved.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, the story is another spectacular addition to the series! It’s filled with danger, action, suspense, twists, violence, betrayals, angst, drama, smoking-hot passion and incredible characters.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI couldn’t put it down and absolutely loved every page of it!\u003cbr /\u003eAnd, with that epilogue, I cannot wait to see what happens next!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B86H6P4DHSMQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:116725221":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":116725221,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":7,"textReviewsCount":2556,"name":"Tkmla","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/116725221-tkmla","contributor":null,"id":116725221},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1MKADV48RUSR1":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MKADV48RUSR1"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MKADV48RUSR1\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1MKADV48RUSR1","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MKADV48RUSR1"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/116725221?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5843335203"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.qU95updRMKup59jKA409sA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.qU95updRMKup59jKA409sA","creator":{"__ref":"User:116725221"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1694767516286,"createdAt":1694767512402,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1694767516140,"text":"„Schmutziger Lord“ von Alison Aimes ist der vierte Band ihrer spannenden Herzlose Warlords Reihe, die in ihrem eigens kreierten Omegaverse spielt.\u003cbr /\u003eDamien Skolov war immer der Jüngste unter den Skolov Brüdern und kämpft wortwörtlich seit Jahren gegen dieses Image an, erst als Cagefighter und inzwischen als gnadenloser Enforcer der Familie. Nur einmal zeigte er vor vier Jahren seine schwache Seite, aber seine Liebe zu Tänzerin Scarlett endete in Betrug und mit einem gebrochenen Herzen. Doch jetzt ist Damien zurück auf einer besonderen Mission und dabei genießt er besonders den Teil, bei dem er endlich Rache an Scarlett nehmen kann, die ihn einst verschmähte. Damien ahnt nicht, weshalb sich Scarlett gegen eine gemeinsame Zukunft entschied und sie hat auch nicht vor, ihre Geheimnisse preiszugeben. Aber gegen die gegenseitige Anziehung sind beide machtlos. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIch würde auf jeden Fall empfehlen, alle Bände in der vorgesehenen Reihenfolge zu lesen und auch das Prequel zu diesem Buch sollte man sich nicht entgehen lassen. Alison Aimes hat auch für Damien eine einzigartige und mitreißende Lovestory erschaffen, die genau zu seinem Charakter passt und die einen dahinschmelzen lässt.\u003cbr /\u003eDas gebrochene Herz von Damien wurde von seinen Brüdern schon öfter angesprochen und ich war sehr neugierig, was damals wirklich passiert ist. Aufklärung gibt das Prequel „Schmutzige Anfänge“, welches die Geschehnisse vor vier Jahren erzählt. Die eigentliche Geschichte ist quasi eine Second Chance Lovestory, in der beide Hauptcharaktere über die Verletzungen der Vergangenheit hinwegkommen müssen. \u003cbr /\u003eScarlett ist wieder eine großartige Frauenfigur, die in manchen Momenten viel stärker wirkt, als die körperlich überlegenen Alphas. Genau deshalb liebe ich diese Reihe, denn sie lässt ihre Helden auf Augenhöhe agieren, auch wenn die Gesellschaftsform völlig gegenteilig konstruiert ist. \u003cbr /\u003eDas heiße Knistern zwischen Scarlett und Damien schlägt sehr hohe Funken und es gibt unglaublich viele unerwartete Twists. Das begeistert mich jedes Mal aufs Neue, genau wie die berührende Entwicklung und die Tiefe der Charaktere. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMein Fazit:\u003cbr /\u003eVon mir gibt es eine klare Leseempfehlung und ich bin sehr gespannt auf die Abenteuer von Anya! \u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MKADV48RUSR1\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.HFFAaRNyC04aPPfr\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:84623690":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":84623690,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":3435,"name":"Sue","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/84623690-sue","contributor":null,"id":84623690},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/84623690?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5591840572"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023060222.739b47e9-28e0-48bd-9907-061cb5048ef8":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023060222.739b47e9-28e0-48bd-9907-061cb5048ef8","creator":{"__ref":"User:84623690"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1685743893750,"createdAt":1685743846139,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1685743893605,"text":"Damien Skolov meets his fated mate Scarlett and fights in the tournament to save her before betrayal\u003cbr /\u003eDamien had gone to take part in a tournament where the winner would win a huge payment as well as the prize who in this case was Scarlett, from the moment that Damien had seen her in her crystal cage he had known she was his fated mate and she had known that she was “His”.\u003cbr /\u003eHowever, as the pair had been meeting secretly and Damien had been showing Scarlet how much he loved his Fated Mate and assured her that when he won the tournament, she would be his Prize Omega, she would accompany him everywhere and she would raise his children.\u003cbr /\u003eThis was the first time she had ever known any happiness but the Brotherhood have long arms and are able to obtain evidence they can use against Scarlett and the only way she can keep the two men she cares for safe her brother and Damien safe is by caring out their instructions so he can not attain his goals and she would be forced into a living hell.\u003cbr /\u003eFour years later and Damien and his brothers are now back together and they are at another of the Brotherhood tournaments and when he sees her again for the first time it is as though time has stopped and she is still to be his Prime Omega, but he hates her for the betrayal that caused his friend to lose his life in the tournament. There is so much he does not know about the hell she has suffered over the last four years and she will never tell him, she is too ashamed.\u003cbr /\u003eI guarantee that when you begin reading this imply amazing book that you will not be able to put it down until you reach the end and discover the outcome.\u003cbr /\u003eI assure you that you will love every moment of this book it is simply a fantastic read.\u003cbr /\u003eI voluntarily received and review an Advanced Reader Copy\u003cbr /\u003eI thoroughly enjoyed the book and look forward to reading any future publications; keep up all the great writing.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOXRNQCLC69GE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:123616945":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":123616945,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1606786503i/123616945._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":101,"name":"Anna","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/123616945-anna","contributor":null,"id":123616945},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3JBQZEXED20YW":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JBQZEXED20YW"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JBQZEXED20YW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3JBQZEXED20YW","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JBQZEXED20YW"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/123616945?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4133418600"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.tVjGxHqLIJu1rpSFH5HemA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.tVjGxHqLIJu1rpSFH5HemA","creator":{"__ref":"User:123616945"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1698367108583,"createdAt":1698281176062,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1698367108419,"text":"Filthy Royal is one scorchingly hot and delicious Omegaverse Romance! I adore anything Alison writes, but WOWZA.. Damien is my favorite character she has written so far! Alison can bring you into her fantastical and smutty world that she creates through her attention to all details in these alien worlds. They seem like they are just beautiful and enchanting.. \u003cbr /\u003e This is book 4 of her Ruthless Warlords Series, but.. yes it is a standalone, but you’d be just fine following along. I highly recommend starting from the beginning. It’s just so much more sexy and fun that way! Damien and Scarlett’s love story was so different from the other books.. it was hot yes, but complicated with misunderstandings,meddling siblings, protecting, and my favorite …. Fated Mates! (Yum to that Taming Chain)… I’ts lovers to enemies to lovers again. Damien is one cocky cage fighter, who falls for the beautiful omega prize Scarlett, whos unique Omega gift is both beautiful and dangerous. This story spans four years in time in which our young cage fighter nobody knows to a feared Mafia boss within the galaxy. Their road to get back to each other and trust was not easy. I loved all of the action. (Excuse me, Miss Alison…that claiming mud scene?! hot AF ma’am!)\u003cbr /\u003e Stella Hunter and Jason Clarke narrate this in duet style. Stella is always one of my favorite narrators because she can do any type of character! From innocent, scared to sexy siren in a flash. You feel all the emotions from her. Jason is always top-tier in these types of characters. Super growly, cocky, defiant, arrogant, but then can turn on that emotion of vulnerability, longing and need so damn well. And of course, Jason has you covered with too many to count “Good Girl”… that he delivers with that gravely tone so well! ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JBQZEXED20YW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:41696045":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":41696045,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":577,"name":"K","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/41696045-k","contributor":null,"id":41696045},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/APZCHF15KRXIB":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/APZCHF15KRXIB"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/APZCHF15KRXIB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/APZCHF15KRXIB","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/APZCHF15KRXIB"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/41696045?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5956064437"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.RYfAyP4EGYnYj_ykJnf43w":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.RYfAyP4EGYnYj_ykJnf43w","creator":{"__ref":"User:41696045"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1700111811359,"createdAt":1699325254550,"spoilerStatus":true,"lastRevisionAt":1700111811193,"text":"NB: Spoilers are alluded to only.\u003cbr /\u003eI enjoyed this book \u0026amp; its characters (main \u0026amp; supporting), even more than Filthy Beginnings #4A - the start of this storyline. I definitely want to read more from this author in the future. But... there are a few things that I found could have been handled slightly differently - it's probably just me nit picking thou.\u003cbr /\u003eThe intimacy is very drawn-out (similar to Filthy Beginnings) for around half the book. There are just moments caught between high activity. This eventually became slightly repetitive. \u003cbr /\u003eFortunately MC's do eventually reveal their personal thoughts, feelings \u0026amp; reasoning with each other BEFORE the last chapter, which is great, otherwise it can be extremely frustrating for the reader, who knows they just need to be honest with each other. \u003cbr /\u003eWeirdly, non-heterosexual sexuality isn't something even mentioned in this universe (until second half of book), either/neither bisexual, homosexual, asexual or any other sexuality. Which is strange, given: the futuristic nature of the story; that other species can/do interact regularly; and that interspecies procreation can also be possible \u0026amp; fairly common - you'd expect different preferences and anatomies within such a diverse advanced society, would breed acceptance that, nothing is \"normal\".\u003cbr /\u003eThere's also the question of why the female MC (Scarlett) would even think that the person she cares about (ie male MC Damien) could be ignorant/intolerant. If she was so unsure of a love interests opinion, on an important topic, couldn't/wouldn't she of, broached the subject in a nonspecific way, to gleen their views/prejudices etc earlier.\u003cbr /\u003eI was confused as to why the \"unspoken\" topic isn't/wasn't in any other area of the story. You don't hear/see any indications of intolerance elsewhere in the narrative, its not in any of the different characters (eg no slurs, \"jokes\" etc are spoken), or generally in their society (arrests, rules stated somewhere or by someone etc). It wasn’t once specifically referenced until the last stages of the book.\u003cbr /\u003eBut I'm probably diving too deep into a work of romantic fiction.\u003cbr /\u003eI do really like the storyline, \u0026amp; all but 1 (because of their above question avoidance \u0026amp; assumptions - unnecessary martyrdom annoys me) of the \"good guy\" characters (the \"bad\" ones didn't have any redeeming features). I enjoyed (\u0026amp; appreciated) all the characters' realistic thoughts/actions/dialogue, etc. And there are a couple of things I didn't see coming at all, total surprises. Finally, I think the title is a misnomer. Nothing in this book was 'filthy' or 'royal'. Male MC continuously describing the relationship as 'filthy' was incongruous.","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/APZCHF15KRXIB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.uvGGFOYs67YKct_T\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:96798870":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":96798870,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1622770522i/96798870._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":16,"name":"Christen","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/96798870-christen","contributor":null,"id":96798870},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/96798870?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5329546128"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023060819.3b30ba08-c57f-4223-a1bb-c8e5acc41391":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2023060819.3b30ba08-c57f-4223-a1bb-c8e5acc41391","creator":{"__ref":"User:96798870"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1686308989781,"createdAt":1686254071876,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1686308989781,"text":"WOW... Damien and Scarlett's long awaited story is finally out (I gratefully received an advanced reader copy of it)! Normally, I would read Alison's books in a weekend (gorging on them, actually), but this feels like an XXL size book and you will totally get your money's worth! SO, it took me a little longer to read as **this is a story to savor!*** No sneaking bits in between work calls, no. I had to devote some serious ME time to soak it in. ;-)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis story takes place in the Golden Dome - a brutal gladiator-type place - or glamorous, depending on your point of view. Like the others in the Ruthless Warlords series, the story has lots of action, some dark themes (slavery of beings is the norm in the Anarchiem universe), fated mates agonizingly separated for years, and there's STEAM. Oh yes, Damien and Scarlett together... mmhmm. The prequel makes this a lovers-to-enemies-to-lovers romance. Obviously, even when they're enemies, the sparks fly. Whoooo - that mud scene! There is some secondary MM romance, but the naughty bits are off-page.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOther Skolov family characters feature in this book, so there's still a warm-hearted feeling to this dark romance. They are an awesome, kick-butt family.\u003cbr /\u003eI won't spoil anything else here, but I am SALIVATING for Anya's story. Ever since his bit part early in the Ruthless Warriors series, I've been fascinated with the idea of a certain uptight Federation officer brought to his knees. Wheeee!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3KQO0YBE1LJFH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.zdOXOTJbxJTqdg9-\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1}},"params":{"book_id":"55919441-filthy-royal"},"query":{"book_id":"55919441-filthy-royal"},"jwtToken":null,"dataSource":"Production","authContextParams":{"signedIn":false,"customerId":null,"legacyCustomerId":null,"role":"user"},"userAgentContextParams":{"isWebView":null},"userAgent":"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64;